WEBVTT

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.290
Beautiful! It looks as if it's alive.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.770
I wonder how this is possible.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.130
I wish I could make a doll like this.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.610
They're all lovely. These are
what one expect of Kasumi Kimihara.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.610
Kasumi Kimihara? Who is that?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:36.620
- You came without knowing anything?
- Sorry.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.450
She's a doll artist, huge among girls.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.290
She's somewhere around here.
Oh, see? There!

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.250
Ms. Kimihara, congratulations
on your success.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.130
- Thank you.
- As your fans' representative...

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.790
...can I ask how you create
such beautiful dolls?

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.980
Easy. You just need to love the dolls.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.170
Oh, I see.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:06.510
"Love the dolls"? Remarks by
a top artist like her is strange.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.420
She sounded high and mighty.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:12.780
If these dolls were real,
I'd fall in love. Right, Miyu?

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.580
You'll get in trouble
if you move the doll.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.170
Don't worry. I'll put it back.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.490
Make sure you don't get caught.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.600
It's back to how it was.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:28.260
Probably you might get controlled
by these dolls.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:19.180
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:23.620
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:29.630
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.030
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.170
...in the human world.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:41.030
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:47.680
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:53.380
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:57.490
No one knows her true face.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.560
Thank you for your hard work today.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.760
Same to you.

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:42.060
By the way, living in such a mansion
all by yourself must be very tiring.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.970
I'm finally used to it.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:50.300
Besides, I have my dolls with me.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.240
What a jerk.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.750
I'm home!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.330
I'm sorry to come home so late.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.660
That gallery owner wouldn't
let me leave.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.600
He is really persistent.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.410
I'm home.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:36.820
I missed you, darling.
I have a really good wine.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:43.090
Let's eat right away. Okay?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.030
My doll exhibit?

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:57.140
Yes, it's very popular.
Everyone compliments me...

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.110
...because all my dolls look alive.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.450
Are you jealous?

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:11.790
Don't be silly. No other dolls
are as beautiful as you are.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.330
God used my hands to create
and send you into this world.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:21.370
You are beauty itself, my loved one.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:32.390
When I created you,
this is what I thought.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:38.520
You are not a doll. You are someone
born into this world for me.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.880
I'm happiest when we cuddle
like this together.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:46.490
I was born to enjoy
this time with you.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.690
Don't you agree with me?

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.140
Oh, I'm so happy.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:59.670
You are the only one
who accepts my love.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:08.350
As long as you are by my side...

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.540
...as long as I have you...

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.400
- Let's see. Maybe no one's home.
- Who is it?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.340
It's you.
You must be Ms. Kimihara.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.700
That's right, but who are you?

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:39.780
I have come to work for you.
I'm Yuki Fujimura.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:43.540
Nice to meet you, Ms. Kimihara.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:48.650
Yes, I sent her to you.
She's pretty good, isn't she?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.920
What were you thinking?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.600
There's too much
to do around the house.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.560
We'd like you to concentrate
on creating more dolls.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.320
So you sent me a maid?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.230
You shouldn't be worried
about such things.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:07.740
Give all the busy work to her
and you concentrate on creating art.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.170
How did this come about?

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.890
Darling...

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:42.110
- Are you done with your call?
- Yes.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:46.370
What can I do?

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:51.050
Come with me. I'll show you around.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.510
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.240
Why did you decide to come here?

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.130
Because...

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:11.060
I'm a big fan. If I could be
of any help to you...

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.300
...it makes me happy.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:17.210
My fan?
Let me show you around downstairs.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:21.010
Ms. Kimihara, we haven't been
in that room.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.740
That room...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:28.420
It's an important room to me,
so don't go near it.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:31.180
Ms. Kimihara, wait for me!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.560
Would you like more?

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.630
Yuki, I didn't ask for tea.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:23.440
I'm so sorry. I was hoping
I could please you.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.380
But if I irritated you,
I will take it back.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:31.810
It's not that I'm mad or anything.
I just want to concentrate on my work.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:36.320
I'm very sorry. Please excuse me.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:58.810
Delicious.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:15.620
It doesn't feel like my own house.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.210
Stop it!

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:42.480
- Ms. Kimihara!
- You, what are you doing here?

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.680
I was just cleaning this room.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:50.530
I had no idea
such a beautiful doll was in here.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.630
Don't touch this doll!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.330
Ms. Kimihara?

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:03.540
I mean, it's an important doll.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:08.190
You understand, Yuki?
If you do, you can leave for now.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:12.910
Yes. I'll excuse myself then.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.980
I'm home, darling.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.320
I'm so sorry.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:21.080
I haven't spent much time
with you lately.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:23.450
I'm so lonesome.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.910
Your lips...

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.060
...wet.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:42.570
Yuki! Where are you, Yuki?

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:48.350
- Yuki!
- Ms. Kimihara, what's wrong?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:52.990
- You, did you disobey my order?
- What are you talking about?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:57.180
Don't play dumb!
You touched that doll, didn't you?

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:01.090
Not only did you touch it, but...

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.600
Say it!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:11.230
Ms. Kimihara, I have no idea
what you are talking about.

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:20.610
You must be tired, Ms. Kimihara.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.180
I'll bring you some tea right away.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:28.780
Not now. Just leave me alone.

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:54.980
What am I doing?

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:36.280
Why do I have to be irritated?
I can't be jealous.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:47.040
KIMIHARA'S NEW HIGH SPEED
PRODUCTION PROCESS

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.770
- New dolls!
- It's been only two months...

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:55.640
...since the last exhibit. Is it
that easy to make so many dolls?

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.940
Maybe she's on a roll.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.940
Just like always,
her dolls are good-looking.

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.280
Let me take a closer look.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:08.450
They sure are good-looking,
but they also look scary.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:09.850
Scary?

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.990
Somehow they all look
like they hate someone.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.830
Let me see.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.430
- See? Don't you agree?
- I can't really tell.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.690
Miyu, don't you think
they look kind of scary?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.960
I wonder if these really
are Kimihara creations?

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.730
They almost look like
someone else's creations.

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.940
Someone else.

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.820
I can't ignore this uneasy feeling.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.670
This beauty, this loving feeling...

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:41.970
...it is just out of this world.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.890
Yuki, how dare you?

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.470
Unforgivable!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:12.410
Let's kiss passionately again tonight.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:21.350
Ms. Kimihara, you've finally come.

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:26.980
Unforgivable! I will
never forgive you both!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:37.300
You accepted love
from someone other than me!

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:42.180
You responded to Yuki's love!
You are not loving only me!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.890
- Ms. Kimihara.
- I can't believe it.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:08.900
I can't believe you are
aiming that knife at me!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.370
- What is it?
- Isn't it just a doll?

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.600
How do you like it?
I look alive, don't I?

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:20.300
Whether you pour love or hatred
into a doll, it gives it life.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.490
No matter how silly the love is.

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:27.290
KAl-RAI

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.960
No, the man I loved was not
a monster like you.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.920
You are calling me a monster?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.830
Ms. Kimihara!

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:45.560
That's not what you should call me.
You love me so much.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:49.240
Ms. Kimihara, let's run away! Hurry!

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:53.140
Because you loved me
and hated me so much...

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:56.840
...I was able to get so much power.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.650
What?

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.190
- Let's go now!
- Inconceivable!

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:09.660
You are a helpless Shinma.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:14.820
You, Guardian!
But no one can interrupt me!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:37.620
It's no use.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:42.660
A doll is only an empty shell.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:48.230
Even if it's an empty shell,
if it's used wisely...

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:50.490
You are dumb.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:58.500
- What?
- Shinma, into the darkness!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:11.780
Really, nothing but an empty shell.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.260
Nothing is left.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:24.990
My love, my everything...

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:29.040
Nothing, absolutely nothing.

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:33.940
Ms. Kimihara, I knew all along.

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:39.240
You didn't want to love someone.
You wanted someone to love you.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:43.550
Just like this.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.900
Just like this.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.900
I wanted to be loved.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.640
Kasumi.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:16.990
They look like they are alive!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.890
After handsome male dolls
come pretty girl dolls.

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:25.670
A young and spirited doll artist.
Her name is Yuki Fujimura.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.060
As your fans' representative...

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:32.500
...I'd like to ask how you can
create such beautiful dolls.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.400
Easy. You just need to love the dolls.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:37.940
And isn't that Kasumi Kimihara?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.110
I heard a rumor those two are lovers.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.580
Lovers? Oh, come on!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:48.750
A pitiful person, allowing
her soul to be manipulated...

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:51.010
...with an illusion called love.

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:19.280
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:21.820
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:25.960
...from so far away?

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:28.790
Someone smooths down my hair

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:33.060
Who are you?

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:39.730
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:44.570
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:49.040
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:53.520
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:57.710
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:02.200
Washed away

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:08.990
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:13.430
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:17.370
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:26.540
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:33.720
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:46.930
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:47.140 --> 00:23:49.470
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:53.610
...from so far away?

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:56.450
Someone smooths down my hair

00:23:56.650 --> 00:24:00.710
Who are you?

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:07.380
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:07.600 --> 00:24:12.230
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:16.700
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:21.170
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.380 --> 00:24:25.380
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:25.580 --> 00:24:29.850
Washed away

00:24:32.550 --> 00:24:36.650
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.860 --> 00:24:41.090
Invited by the moon

00:24:41.300 --> 00:24:45.040
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.670 --> 00:24:54.200
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.440 --> 00:25:01.370
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.490 --> 00:25:10.010
A beautiful butterfly
led me to a girl.

00:25:10.790 --> 00:25:14.190
A hollow love,
nurtured in a green house.

00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:17.670
Illusionary pages flipped one by one.

00:25:17.870 --> 00:25:21.540
The butterfly spreads its wings,
attracts people...

00:25:21.740 --> 00:25:24.400
...to dreams and hides reality.

00:25:24.610 --> 00:25:26.880
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu:

00:25:27.070 --> 00:25:29.270
"Butterfly Enchantment."

00:25:29.480 --> 00:25:32.640
The dream, too sweet.
